---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import SiteHeader from '../components/SiteHeader.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../components/SiteFooter.astro';
import { CONTACT_EMAIL } from '../config';

const effectiveDate = 'October 12, 2026';
---

<Base
	title="Privacy Policy | Missional"
	description="How Missional collects, uses and protects information on missional.io."
>
	<SiteHeader />

	<main class="section">
		<article class="container prose">
			<span class="eyebrow">Legal</span>
			<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
			<p class="prose-meta">Effective {effectiveDate}</p>

			<p>
				This policy explains what information Missional ("we," "us") collects when you visit missional.io, how
				we use it, and the choices you have. Missional is powered by <a href="https://digicomb.io">Digicomb</a>.
			</p>

			<h2>Information we collect</h2>
			<h3>Information you give us</h3>
			<p>
				When you join our waitlist, we collect your email address and, if you choose to provide them, your name,
				your church or organization, and your role. If you email us, we receive your email address and whatever
				you include in your message.
			</p>
			<h3>Information collected automatically</h3>
			<p>
				We use Google Analytics to understand how visitors use the site. Google Analytics uses cookies and
				similar technologies to collect information such as the pages you view, how you arrived at the site, your
				browser and device type, and your approximate location (derived from your IP address). Our hosting
				provider may also record standard server logs, including IP addresses, for security and reliability.
			</p>

			<h2>How we use information</h2>
			<ul>
				<li>To contact you about early access to Missional and related updates.</li>
				<li>To respond to your questions and requests.</li>
				<li>To understand how the site is used so we can improve it.</li>
				<li>To keep the site secure and prevent abuse.</li>
			</ul>
			<p>We do not sell your personal information, and we do not use it for third-party advertising.</p>

			<h2>Service providers</h2>
			<p>We rely on a small number of providers to run this site. They process information on our behalf:</p>
			<ul>
				<li><strong>GitHub Pages</strong>: website hosting.</li>
				<li><strong>Supabase</strong>: secure storage of waitlist signups.</li>
				<li><strong>Resend</strong>: delivery of internal notification emails about new signups.</li>
				<li><strong>Google Analytics</strong>: website usage statistics.</li>
			</ul>
			<p>
				We may also disclose information if required by law, or to protect the rights, safety and security of
				Missional, our users or others.
			</p>

			<h2>How long we keep it</h2>
			<p>
				We keep waitlist information until you ask us to remove it or until we no longer need it to contact you
				about Missional. Google Analytics data is retained according to the retention settings of our Analytics
				account.
			</p>

			<h2>Your choices</h2>
			<ul>
				<li>
					<strong>Remove or update your information:</strong> email <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a> and we'll take care of it.
				</li>
				<li>
					<strong>Unsubscribe:</strong> every email we send about Missional will tell you how to opt out, or you
					can reply and ask.
				</li>
				<li>
					<strong>Analytics:</strong> you can block or delete cookies in your browser settings, or install the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout">Google Analytics opt-out browser add-on</a>.
				</li>
			</ul>
			<p>
				Depending on where you live, you may have additional rights to access, correct or delete your personal
				information. Contact us and we'll respond to your request.
			</p>

			<h2>Security</h2>
			<p>
				We use reasonable safeguards to protect your information. Waitlist signups can be added from the website
				but cannot be read back through it. No method of transmission or storage is completely secure, however.
			</p>

			<h2>Children</h2>
			<p>
				This site is intended for adults planning and organizing mission work. We do not knowingly collect
				personal information from children under 13.
			</p>

			<h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
			<p>
				If we update this policy, we'll post the new version here and change the effective date above.
			</p>

			<h2>Contact us</h2>
			<p>
				Questions about this policy? Email <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>.
			</p>
		</article>
	</main>

	<SiteFooter />
</Base>
